    {
      "text": "detailed like this. I give Claude the",
      "duration": 5521,
      "offset": 331759,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "spec, point it at the documentation, I",
      "duration": 5440,
      "offset": 334400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "tell it which scene to build, it writes",
      "duration": 4880,
      "offset": 337280,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "the code, I preview it in Remotion",
      "duration": 4320,
      "offset": 339840,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Studio, and if something isn't right, I",
      "duration": 3680,
      "offset": 342160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "literally just describe in natural",
      "duration": 4400,
      "offset": 344160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "language what needs to change, and it",
      "duration": 5280,
      "offset": 345840,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "adjusts. We iterate until the scene",
      "duration": 4639,
      "offset": 348560,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "matches what I had in mind. The",
      "duration": 4480,
      "offset": 351120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "component library matters at this point",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 353199,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "because I'm not building every single",
      "duration": 3439,
      "offset": 355600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "animation from scratch. It's not like",
      "duration": 4081,
      "offset": 357199,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "every time I'm making a video, I'm just",
      "duration": 3921,
      "offset": 359039,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "starting from fresh. I actually have",
      "duration": 3440,
      "offset": 361280,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "building blocks that are traditional",
      "duration": 3600,
      "offset": 362960,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "code, a text component that handles",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 364720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "entrance animations or enforces readable",
      "duration": 4320,
      "offset": 366560,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "sizes, a scene container that handles",
      "duration": 4479,
      "offset": 368720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "safe margins and backgrounds. Effects",
      "duration": 4480,
      "offset": 370880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "like glitch text or counting numbers.",
      "duration": 4321,
      "offset": 373199,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Claude builds a scene, it assembles",
      "duration": 4480,
      "offset": 375360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "these pieces according to the spec. It's",
      "duration": 4480,
      "offset": 377520,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "not inventing everything new, but rather",
      "duration": 4320,
      "offset": 379840,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "this kind of aspect of like, hey, I",
      "duration": 4080,
      "offset": 382000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "should compose a new element that",
      "duration": 3680,
      "offset": 384160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "already works together in other",
      "duration": 4640,
      "offset": 386080,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "elements. This is just separations of",
      "duration": 4400,
      "offset": 387840,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "concerns. It's the same principle that",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 390720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "makes any complex software manageable.",
      "duration": 4239,
      "offset": 392240,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "The spec is separate from the",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 394720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "implementation. The components are",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 396479,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "reusable. The style guide encodes",
      "duration": 4240,
      "offset": 398720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "decisions so you don't have to make them",
      "duration": 4161,
      "offset": 401199,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "every time. Now, if anyone has written",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 402960,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "software before, this should actually",
      "duration": 3839,
      "offset": 405360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "seem very familiar. And even if you",
      "duration": 3600,
      "offset": 407120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "haven't, just know that this is the",
      "duration": 4161,
      "offset": 409199,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "principle. Break complex things into",
      "duration": 5039,
      "offset": 410720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "smaller pieces that can be understood",
      "duration": 5279,
      "offset": 413360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "and changed independently. From there,",
      "duration": 5361,
      "offset": 415759,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "once the scenes are relatively built, I",
      "duration": 4560,
      "offset": 418639,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "just export it from Remotion or even",
      "duration": 4639,
      "offset": 421120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "just use OBS to record my screen, so I",
      "duration": 3761,
      "offset": 423199,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "don't have to worry about render",
      "duration": 3921,
      "offset": 425759,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "processes or codec errors. And this just",
      "duration": 4560,
      "offset": 426960,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "is something I can upload straight into",
      "duration": 4079,
      "offset": 429680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cap Cut. Now, this is where the",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 431520,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "animation becomes much more of a video.",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 433759,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "I usually do a voice over. I cut and",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 435680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "make sure that it actually syncs up. I",
      "duration": 4801,
      "offset": 438479,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "maybe add some music. And there's some",
      "duration": 4639,
      "offset": 440400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "things that right now are a little bit",
      "duration": 3440,
      "offset": 443280,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "easier to do by hand. So, I haven't",
      "duration": 3521,
      "offset": 445039,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "really automated that process, but I'm",
      "duration": 3680,
      "offset": 446720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "working on it. Now, scrubbing through",
      "duration": 3919,
      "offset": 448560,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "and nudging a transition to land exactly",
      "duration": 4560,
      "offset": 450400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "on a word is honestly faster in a video",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 452479,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "editor than describing it in the spec",
      "duration": 3760,
      "offset": 454960,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "and waiting for code to regenerate. The",
      "duration": 3761,
      "offset": 456639,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "animation is not the finished video.",
      "duration": 3680,
      "offset": 458720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's simply a starting point. Now, it is",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 460400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "a substantial one. I still spend real",
      "duration": 4079,
      "offset": 462400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "time in this phase. I'm cutting so many",
      "duration": 3519,
      "offset": 464400,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "sections that don't work when I hear",
      "duration": 3201,
      "offset": 466479,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "them out loud. I'm re-recording lines",
      "duration": 3680,
      "offset": 467919,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "that don't land. I'm adding photos or",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 469680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "screenshots or footage to support the",
      "duration": 3761,
      "offset": 471599,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "narration. The animations give me a",
      "duration": 3359,
      "offset": 473680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "foundation, but the finished video",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 475360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "requires refinement. So when I say under",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 477039,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "an hour, I mean the animation, the part",
      "duration": 4320,
      "offset": 479360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "that would have taken a week if I was",
      "duration": 4081,
      "offset": 481759,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "doing it frame by frame and After",
      "duration": 4320,
      "offset": 483680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Effects. The finished video still takes",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 485840,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "time, but I'm spending that time on the",
      "duration": 3360,
      "offset": 488000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "parts I actually want to control. The",
      "duration": 3359,
      "offset": 489840,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "pacing, the moments that need a real",
      "duration": 4080,
      "offset": 491360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "image instead of motion graphics. Now,",
      "duration": 4241,
      "offset": 493199,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "the question isn't really about whether",
      "duration": 4080,
      "offset": 495440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "AI can make videos or anything like",
      "duration": 4479,
      "offset": 497440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "that. It's more where do you want to",
      "duration": 5200,
      "offset": 499520,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "spend your creative energy? And for me,",
      "duration": 4960,
      "offset": 501919,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "the answer is not automating from",
      "duration": 4159,
      "offset": 504720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "scratch, not animating everything.",
      "duration": 3600,
      "offset": 506879,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Honestly, I'd rather have something real",
      "duration": 4400,
      "offset": 508879,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "to react and to shape to rather than",
      "duration": 5120,
      "offset": 510479,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "start with a blank timeline or focus on",
      "duration": 5041,
      "offset": 513279,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "the actual content itself. Now, that",
      "duration": 4240,
      "offset": 515599,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "being said, let's zoom out for a second",
      "duration": 3360,
      "offset": 518320,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "because I think what's happening here,",
      "duration": 4080,
      "offset": 519839,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "as I mentioned earlier in the video, is",
      "duration": 5360,
      "offset": 521680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "part of a much larger pattern. When",
      "duration": 6241,
      "offset": 523919,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garage Band came out in 2004, Steve says",
      "duration": 5280,
      "offset": 527040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "he wanted to democratize music making.",
      "duration": 3920,
      "offset": 530160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "And there's this statistic that stuck",
      "duration": 4400,
      "offset": 532320,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "with me. Suddenly, every teenager with a",
      "duration": 4319,
      "offset": 534080,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mac could produce music that would have",
      "duration": 4080,
      "offset": 536720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "required a $100,000 studio. 5 years",
      "duration": 4560,
      "offset": 538399,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "earlier, Steve Lacy made tracks for",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 540800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kendrick Lamar on a cracked iPhone with",
      "duration": 4481,
      "offset": 542959,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "GarageBand and a $20 eye ring. That",
      "duration": 5440,
      "offset": 544800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "phone is now in the Smithsonian. Canva",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 547440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "did something similar for visual design.",
      "duration": 4000,
      "offset": 550240,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melanie Perkins was rejected by over a",
      "duration": 3679,
      "offset": 552160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "hundred investors who didn't think",
      "duration": 3520,
      "offset": 554240,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "design tools for non-designers was a",
      "duration": 3921,
      "offset": 555839,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "real market. Now 200 million people use",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 557760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "it monthly. The pattern is always the",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 559760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "same. A tool emerges that gives people",
      "duration": 3919,
      "offset": 561920,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "access to execution they couldn't do",
      "duration": 4080,
      "offset": 563920,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "before. Not replacing professionals, but",
      "duration": 4161,
      "offset": 565839,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "letting people who have ideas actually",
      "duration": 4240,
      "offset": 568000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "realize them. And there's a really messy",
      "duration": 4480,
      "offset": 570000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "period early on which designers called",
      "duration": 4159,
      "offset": 572240,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "the ransom note effect. When desktop",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 574480,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "publishing first appeared, everyone used",
      "duration": 5601,
      "offset": 576399,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "15 different fonts on one page, but it",
      "duration": 4400,
      "offset": 579200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "kind of went all over. And then over",
      "duration": 3760,
      "offset": 582000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "time, the floor kind of rose. More",
      "duration": 4320,
      "offset": 583600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "people creating means more good work in",
      "duration": 4480,
      "offset": 585760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "absolute terms. Even if the average",
      "duration": 5120,
      "offset": 587920,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "quality takes time to catch up. I think",
      "duration": 5200,
      "offset": 590240,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "we're in that motion or that moment for",
      "duration": 4320,
      "offset": 593040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "AI and animation and video. The tools",
      "duration": 4959,
      "offset": 595440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "exist. The quality can be good. And",
      "duration": 4400,
      "offset": 597360,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "people who couldn't afford a motion",
      "duration": 3201,
      "offset": 600399,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "graphics artist or couldn't justify a",
      "duration": 3519,
      "offset": 601760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "week of their own time can now make",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 603600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "something real. And this might be kind",
      "duration": 5521,
      "offset": 605279,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "of powerive, but I think this is the key",
      "duration": 4400,
      "offset": 607760,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "to how all of this is going to work.",
      "duration": 4640,
      "offset": 610800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's that constraints enable creativity.",
      "duration": 4880,
      "offset": 612160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "There's actual research on this. An",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 615440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "inverted U-shaped relationship between",
      "duration": 5840,
      "offset": 617040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "constraints and creative output. Too few",
      "duration": 5200,
      "offset": 619600,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "constraints, you get paralysis, the",
      "duration": 4240,
      "offset": 622880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "blank canvas problem. Too many, you",
      "duration": 4159,
      "offset": 624800,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "actually get stifled. But right in the",
      "duration": 3520,
      "offset": 627120,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "middle, with the right boundaries,",
      "duration": 5041,
      "offset": 628959,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "creativity actually increases. Dr. Zeus",
      "duration": 5920,
      "offset": 630640,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "wrote Green Eggs and Ham because his",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 634000,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "editor bet him $50 he couldn't write a",
      "duration": 4640,
      "offset": 636560,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "book with only 50 words. He made",
      "duration": 4799,
      "offset": 638720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "flowcharts on his walls to track his",
      "duration": 5520,
      "offset": 641200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "vocabulary. And the book sold 200",
      "duration": 5921,
      "offset": 643519,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "million copies, and it is his best",
      "duration": 5679,
      "offset": 646720,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "selling work ever. Spielberg couldn't",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 649440,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "get the mechanical shark to work in",
      "duration": 4481,
      "offset": 652399,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Jaws, so he showed floating barrels and",
      "duration": 5040,
      "offset": 654160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "point off view shots instead. The shark",
      "duration": 4160,
      "offset": 656880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "doesn't fully appear until 80 minutes",
      "duration": 4480,
      "offset": 659200,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "into the film. The constraint made it",
      "duration": 5200,
      "offset": 661040,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "better somehow. The spec, the style",
      "duration": 4560,
      "offset": 663680,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "guide, the component registry, these",
      "duration": 3920,
      "offset": 666240,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "aren't limitations I work around.",
      "duration": 3920,
      "offset": 668240,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "They're boundaries that make the output",
      "duration": 4720,
      "offset": 670160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "better. Instead, this case, Claude is",
      "duration": 4560,
      "offset": 672160,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "now the one constrained. It knows the",
      "duration": 4079,
      "offset": 674880,
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "rules. It focuses on execution instead",
